  <entry>
    <id>tag:github.com,2008:Grit::Commit/1438213bd00b5304c31b5bc86437852030c72dc4</id>
    <link type="text/html" rel="alternate" href="https://github.com/Rhythm-Kachhwaha/AnkiMiner/commit/1438213bd00b5304c31b5bc86437852030c72dc4"/>
    <title>
        Phase 3: SQLite persistence, duplicate prevention, fix RemoteDisconne…
    </title>
    <updated>2026-09-09T18:43:05Z</updated>
    <media:thumbnail height="30" width="30" url="https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/117747727?s=30&amp;v=4"/>
    <author>
      <name>Rhythm-Kachhwaha</name>
      <uri>https://github.com/Rhythm-Kachhwaha</uri>
    </author>
    <content type="html">
      &lt;pre style=&#39;white-space:pre-wrap;width:81ex&#39;&gt;Phase 3: SQLite persistence, duplicate prevention, fix RemoteDisconnected 500 regression

Phase 2 pipeline preserved intact. Phase 3 adds:
- app/db/connection.py: SQLite connection lifecycle, WAL mode, schema init
- app/repositories/card_repository.py: CardRepository with save/find/count
- app/services/card_normalizer.py: NFC + whitespace normalization for identity
- app/services/card_service.py: orchestrates identify -&amp;gt; enrich -&amp;gt; save -&amp;gt; response
- backend/tests/test_card_repository.py: 7 repository unit tests (all pass)
- backend/tests/test_capture_integration.py: 4 integration tests (all pass)
- schemas.py: CaptureRequest.deck_name optional, CaptureResponse adds id/status/is_duplicate
- main.py: route delegates to CardService; lifespan calls init_db()
- sidepanel.html/css/js: save-badge for [SAVED]/[ALREADY SAVED] display

Bug fix: YomitanService._post_json now catches OSError (covers RemoteDisconnected)
so Yomitan connection drops return 503 instead of bare 500. Regression test added.

All 20 backend tests pass. Extension unit test passes.
Live Yomitan verification pending.&lt;/pre&gt;
    </content>
  </entry>
